{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "K2Q3XPDFMWYQWWSTFHCHCNZD3NRF5GL7",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041118006",
    "title": " ",
    "enTitle": "Tip of the Iceberg",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "休日。ぶらぶらと街を歩いていると、\nアドマイヤグルーヴを見つけた。",
            "enText": "I was taking a stroll through the local neighborhood \none weekend when I came across Admire Groove.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 88,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 122,
                    "pathId": -6785256956830085007
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 103,
                    "pathId": 7265691334303721097
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5863330665767642738,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……こんにちは。",
            "enText": "…Good day.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 67,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "こんにちは、君も散歩？",
                    "enText": "Hey. Out for a stroll as well?",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "こんにちは、貴方も散歩？",
                    "enText": "Hey. Out for a stroll as well?",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 112,
                    "pathId": 5538575993197029309
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -3566508371224321044
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 224694590287050357,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……いえ。買い出し中です。",
            "enText": "…No, I'm here shopping.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 114,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "トレーニングに必要なもの？",
                    "enText": "Something you need for training?",
                    "nextBlock": 4
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 146,
                    "pathId": 8146527421085201987
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2115424092323160283,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "違います。\n……ただの雑貨なので。",
            "enText": "No… just some things.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 119,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 146,
                    "pathId": -4180402058853147464
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 6056246917309424126
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3389765556939136160,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "相変わらず素っ気ないが、挨拶もしてくれるし、\n質問すれば、答えてもくれる。",
            "enText": "She's as curt to me as ever, but she did deem \nme worthy of a greeting, and even answered \nwhen I asked a question.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 93,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 146,
                    "pathId": -6686042645633803223
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 314690487157599199,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "元々、挨拶くらいはしてくれていたが、\nそれでも出会った頃に比べれば、幾分マシに……なっただろうか？",
            "enText": "Of course, she <i>did</i> always at least greet me, but compared to \nwhen we first met, I do feel like our relationship has improved… \na little bit, maybe?",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 108,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "あ、そうだ。ちょうど昼だし――",
                    "enText": "Ah, hey… it's close to noon…",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 146,
                    "pathId": 8001550650939010068
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7520531273446928309,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "？",
            "enText": "?",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 23,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "一緒にご飯でも、どうかな？",
                    "enText": "What do you say to having lunch together?",
                    "nextBlock": 8
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 146,
                    "pathId": 8167255717797902862
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8931012490103399948,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "結構です。食事はひとりでとります。",
            "enText": "No thank you. I prefer to eat alone.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 114,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 125,
                    "pathId": -370147736353089893
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1108302391019172959,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "にべもなく、断られてしまう。\nわかってはいたが、即答に思わず笑ってしまった。",
            "enText": "Rejected, bluntly and immediately… I hadn't expected \notherwise, but the immediacy of her response was such \nthat I couldn't stop myself laughing.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 94,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 125,
                    "pathId": -7862163981423995864
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6722582681964823622,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……貴方は……。",
            "enText": "…You…",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 72,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 227,
                    "pathId": -7633598069883874375
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8373384774327877884,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "どうして、こうも……。\n…………。",
            "enText": "Why are you so…",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 142,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 186,
                    "pathId": 2750676608073751852
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 56,
                    "pathId": -6876740069223000408
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6262793626623691757,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……。\n……――はぁ。",
            "enText": "<i>……Haaah.</i>",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 174,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 186,
                    "pathId": -5364648964392585122
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 185,
                    "pathId": -8291697895157794283
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6682723983093976633,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "何かを伝えようとし諦めたのか――ここは言いやすいように、\n背中を押してあげた方がいいのだろうか。",
            "enText": "Did she want to say something…? \nPerhaps I should try making it easier on her.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 107,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "もしも言いたいことがあるなら、遠慮は――",
                    "enText": "<size=34>If you need something off your chest, don't hold b—</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 14
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 145,
                    "pathId": -3165016501541046776
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 147,
                    "pathId": 9087674238314352626
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1860896788168324687,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "していませんし、言いたいこともありません。",
            "enText": "I am not and I have nothing to say to you.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 108,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 150,
                    "pathId": -3516986910832559622
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 8797371750959609475
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2576286540858769185,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……そろそろ、失礼します。\n私にも予定がありますので。",
            "enText": "…I will excuse myself here, I have other things to do.",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 240,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ちょっ、もう少し話を――！",
                    "enText": "Ah, wait, I wanted to cha—!",
                    "nextBlock": 16
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -4625737888263815665
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7420743562029423168,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……何かを言いかけたことだけは、確かだ。\n無理に言わせたいわけではないが、せめてもう少し話ができれば――",
            "enText": "…She definitely had something to say. I don't want to force it \nout of her, but if I could only talk with her just a little more…",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 112,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -6388022946591198665,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……偶然とはいえ、休日にまで会うなんて。",
            "enText": "…Coincidence as it may be, why do I have to spend \nmy time with you even on a weekend.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 162,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 299,
                    "pathId": 6488931789949727388
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6761365793424817412,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（……なにを言っても平然としていて、懲りない人。\nあのくらいでないと、トレーナーにはなれないのかしら）",
            "enText": "(…This person never learns, never backs down. Nothing I say \nseems to faze them. Perhaps you need to be that obstinate \nto be a trainer?)",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 324,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 232,
                    "pathId": -3095623161290487000
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1639274517316556091,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "…………。",
            "enText": "………",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 124,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 389,
                    "pathId": -969860269095631728
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3218388724560070201,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（別に……どうでもいいことね。私には、関係ない。\nどうせ、トリプルティアラまでの限定契約なのだから）",
            "enText": "(…Not that it matters. It has nothing to do with me. \nUltimately, our contract ends with the triple tiara.)",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 360,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 389,
                    "pathId": -6825706114012199430
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 154,
                    "pathId": -2501114147830701879
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2030709606545014439,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "私は私の目的を果たす……信頼も絆も、必要ない。\n煩わしいものは、捨てていけばいい。",
            "enText": "I'll accomplish that which I set out to do. \nTrust, bonds… such things are irrelevant to me. \nAnything bothersome… I'll discard.",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 328,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 372,
                    "pathId": -179441419994718811
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 367,
                    "pathId": -3487580018206749265
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7925832625096833066,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……だって、どうせ。",
            "enText": "…Because, in the end…",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 125,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 96,
                    "pathId": 7870894875791532377
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -8981519940791993614
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -752079885454861100,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハキハキとした女性",
            "enName": "Peppy Woman",
            "jpText": "そこのウマ娘さん！\nほら、ちょっと見て見て。かわいいでしょ～。",
            "enText": "Hey there, young horselady! \nHave a look at these guys, aren't they cute?",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 178,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 18,
                    "pathId": -6490876303198147792
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1527391541893246215,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "！",
            "enText": "!",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 32,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "pathId": 7704186787073342196,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハキハキとした女性",
            "enName": "Peppy Woman",
            "jpText": "こんにちは！\nあなた、ワンちゃんは好きかしら？",
            "enText": "Greetings, greetings! Tell me, do you like puppers?",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 122,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 180,
                    "pathId": 1497687644107938359
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2868366914132355634,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……――犬？\n『里親の会』……。",
            "enText": "…Dogs? \"Fosters Society\"…",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 148,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 180,
                    "pathId": -1869662763186098327
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 114,
                    "pathId": 205751382717406823
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3105012380224054444,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハキハキとした女性",
            "enName": "Peppy Woman",
            "jpText": "そうよ～。この子たちの家族になってくれる人を探しているの！\n今日は子犬しかいないけど、成犬もいてね……。",
            "enText": "That's us! We're trying to find these guys a new home! \nI only have pups with me today, but there are some older \ndogs with us too…",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 284,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 335,
                    "pathId": -3615123318137456803
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 8606494993106426371
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1997270568305477208,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハキハキとした女性",
            "enName": "Peppy Woman",
            "jpText": "ねっ、抱っこしてみない？\n大丈夫、子犬たちだし怖くないわよ！",
            "enText": "Would you like to try holding one? Here, take your pick. \nNo worries, these little ones won't hurt you!",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 193,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 335,
                    "pathId": 6188544501397405330
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 118,
                    "pathId": -8746402667482527654
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8555361280632681311,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……………………。\n……………………遠慮、します。",
            "enText": "………………I would rather not.",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 254,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -5880425660020492175
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -5124660513670313262
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -225663222409444156,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハキハキとした女性",
            "enName": "Peppy Woman",
            "jpText": "遠慮しなくていいのに！\nあ、もしかして犬は苦手？",
            "enText": "Oh, it's no problem at all, you don't have to hold back, dear! \nOr do you not like doggies, perhaps?",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 159,
            "voiceIdx": 23,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 335,
                    "pathId": 6696842564362159748
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3559439407598189789,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "いいえ。ただ……。",
            "enText": "That's not it, I just…",
            "nextBlock": 32,
            "origClipLength": 68,
            "voiceIdx": 24,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 335,
                    "pathId": 643251976244770392
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 55,
                    "pathId": -6181412912253312362
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1427781444137607241,
            "blockIdx": 31
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "無責任なことは、したくないだけです。\n私は、飼えませんから。",
            "enText": "…I don't want to take on undue responsibility. \nAfter all, I cannot keep one.",
            "nextBlock": 33,
            "origClipLength": 165,
            "voiceIdx": 25,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 215,
                    "pathId": -2537512656077594409
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1277162493306470474,
            "blockIdx": 32
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……ですので、\nその子たちに期待を与えるようなことはさせられません。",
            "enText": "…Consequently, I do not want to give them false hope.",
            "nextBlock": 34,
            "origClipLength": 187,
            "voiceIdx": 26,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 240,
                    "pathId": -7055256973013973226
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 163,
                    "pathId": 3555628664871217574
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3518573837791934256,
            "blockIdx": 33
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "――ムダに傷つけるだけです。",
            "enText": "…It will only hurt them needlessly.",
            "nextBlock": 35,
            "origClipLength": 65,
            "voiceIdx": 27,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 121,
                    "pathId": 7039836956715073186
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 128,
                    "pathId": -2695003027006524255
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1885069628057002036,
            "blockIdx": 34
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハキハキとした女性",
            "enName": "Peppy Woman",
            "jpText": "あら……真剣に考えてくれてるのね、ありがとう！\n気になったら、またいつでも会いに来てちょうだいね。",
            "enText": "My… I'll have to thank you for giving it such serious thought. \nIf you ever change your mind, please feel welcome to visit us \nanytime, alright?",
            "nextBlock": 36,
            "origClipLength": 260,
            "voiceIdx": 28,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 300,
                    "pathId": 8786210490118107113
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -5872967899972081594
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4316088502980544577,
            "blockIdx": 35
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハキハキとした女性",
            "enName": "Peppy Woman",
            "jpText": "――あ、そちらの方、その子が気になります？\nちょっと待ってくださいね、その子は……。",
            "enText": "…Oh, would <i>you</i> like to hold one? This one here take \nyour interest? Just a moment. This one, see ——",
            "nextBlock": 37,
            "origClipLength": 201,
            "voiceIdx": 29,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 213,
                    "pathId": -4527708164859722806
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 86,
